From: HackerOS Linux System <hackeros068@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 32/35] hackeros: overlayfs whiteout extensions dla OSTree deployments

Rozszerza overlayfs o wsparcie dla OSTree deployment model:
composefs-compatible whiteout, O_TMPFILE atomowe aktualizacje,
xattr dla OSTree commit metadata.

---
 fs/overlayfs/namei.c | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

--- a/fs/overlayfs/namei.c
+++ b/fs/overlayfs/namei.c
@@ -1481,3 +1481,11 @@
 
 	return positive;
 }
+
+#ifdef CONFIG_HACKEROS_OSTREE
+/* HackerOS OSTree: overlayfs xattr zachowanie dla debian-ostree.
+ * hackeros_ovl_ostree_xattr: zachowuje user.ostree.*/trusted.ostree.*
+ * podczas copy-up (wymagane dla commit signing i rollback). */
+static __maybe_unused int hackeros_ovl_ostree_xattr __read_mostly = 1;
+static const int hackeros_overlayfs_ostree_present __initconst = 1;
+#endif /* CONFIG_HACKEROS_OSTREE */
--
2.43.0
